        "abstract": "<jats:p>In this article we describe the formalisation of the Bruhat-Tits tree - an important tool in modern number theory - in the Lean Theorem Prover. Motivated by the goal of connecting to ongoing research, we apply our formalisation to verify a result about harmonic cochains on the tree.</jats:p>\n                  <jats:p>27 pages. Final version, to appear in Annals of Formalized Mathematics</jats:p>",
